<BaseLayout title="Join Us" active="join-us" description="Join AEEL at Korea University for research in advanced electronic devices and energy conversion.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="shell page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Join us</span><h1>Build what comes next,<br />together.</h1><p>We are interested in curious, collaborative researchers who want to turn emerging materials into useful devices.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell contact-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Opportunities</span><h2 class="join-title">Find your place in AEEL.</h2><p class="intro-copy">The lab welcomes inquiries from applicants interested in postdoctoral research, graduate study, and undergraduate research leading toward graduate study.</p><div class="role-list"><div>Postdoctoral researchers</div><div>Graduate students · MS / PhD integrated or PhD</div><div>Undergraduate researchers · graduate linked course</div></div><p class="source-note">Open positions and eligibility may change. Contact the lab for current opportunities.</p></div><aside class="contact-panel"><span class="eyebrow">Get in touch</span><h3>Start a conversation.</h3><p>Introduce yourself, your research interests, and the kind of project you hope to pursue. Attach your CV if appropriate.</p><p><strong>Professor Jae Won Shim</strong><br /><a href="mailto:jwshim19@korea.ac.kr">jwshim19@korea.ac.kr ↗</a></p><p><strong>Visit</strong><br />Korea University<br />145, Anam-ro, Seongbuk-gu<br />Seoul, Republic of Korea</p></aside></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
